## 7. Prompts to Write (Day 2–4 of build)

These are the prompts that determine product quality. Write them carefully.
Each should be versioned in `/prompts/` and tested before going into production.

- `prompts/curation_quality_scorer.md` — scores an article against the quality rubric
- `prompts/search_intent_builder.md` — builds the search query from user's syllabus state
- `prompts/curation_rationale_writer.md` — writes the handoff note
- `prompts/question_generator.md` — generates the quiz question from chunks + user context
- `prompts/answer_evaluator.md` — evaluates user's free-text answer against expected_concepts
- `prompts/level_descriptors.md` — defines what level 1–5 looks like for each topic

